{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1471193-callings-question","id":1471193,"title":"Callings question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-24T06:29:10-08:00","id":1471193,"title":"Callings question","content":"I've gotten a bit of an odd question (well to me anyway) on Callings. Aside from the ones in Origin and Hero, are there other callings listed anywhere. One of my more RP players is noting (to her) the archetypes are rather limited. I tend to liberally interpret Callings to allow for fun, but the question stands","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-24T07:19:07-08:00","id":1471196,"title":"","content":"There are the Titan Callings (Adversary, Destroyer, Monster, Primeval and Tyrant) in the Titanomachy sourcebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/972-fairlyhyperman","name":"Fairlyhyperman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar972_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-24T11:40:18-08:00","id":1471203,"title":"","content":"What I may suggest you is to point that a Hero has 3 callings, what makes the possible combinations in the order or hundreds without even thinking how to distribute the dots, before going for new callings.<br /> <br /> Sure, you could build others, but it\u2019s more meaningful to work with the combination of concepts for callings, as they are archetypes common to all myths, and be creative with the paths","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-24T16:00:05-08:00","id":1471213,"title":"","content":"Eh, they are Archetypes. Not really meant to be fleshed out. They give abilities suitable to archetypal myth characters, and I think that is a good design choice. As noted there are are the Titanic ones for a few options outside the usual hero model, but I think with some tinkering one can find a trio that suits them. My group is very very heavy RP and we have been quite pleased. Mateus's suggestion with the Paths is also a good one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"